---
title: Delivery state machine (author 523C0001, AI-assisted)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Assigned : acceptOrder() [order ReadyForPickup, same hub, not taken]
    Assigned --> PickedUp : pickUp() / order.PickUp() (order OutForDelivery)
    PickedUp --> Delivered : confirmDelivered(cash) [cash = total if COD] / order.Deliver(), payment.Settle()
    PickedUp --> Failed : reportFailure(reason) [reason given] / order.FailDelivery(), payment.Void()
    Delivered --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    note right of PickedUp
        The shipper is responsible for the
        order and its cash from here
    end note
